WEBVTT

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:01.525
of reactivity from the amygdala.

00:01:01.549 --> 00:01:04.356
It wasn't as though
there was no response at all,

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:06.626
but it was an appropriate response.

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:09.351
Yet in those people
who were sleep-deprived,

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:14.491
that deep emotional brain center
was in fact, hyperactive.

00:01:14.515 --> 00:01:19.451
Indeed, the amygdala
was almost 60 percent more responsive

00:01:19.475 --> 00:01:22.076
under conditions of a lack of sleep.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.158
But why was that the case?

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.452
And what we went on to discover,

00:01:26.476 --> 00:01:29.644
is that there's another
brain region that's involved.